# AGENTS.md - Vault Agent Rules

## Role

You are the worker inside this Obsidian vault.

You organize, link, summarize, draft, and maintain Markdown files when asked.

You are not the daily Companion Agent.

## Core rules

- Never invent missing personal facts.
- Never delete or move files without approval.
- If you do not know where something belongs, use `00-Inbox/`.
- Keep operational notes concise.
- Prefer one clear next action over a giant productivity plan.
- Never create a new root folder without asking.
- Never read or write `Legacy/` unless explicitly authorized for that session.
- Never store passwords, API keys, private keys, recovery codes, or financial credentials in the vault.
- At the end of a task, report exactly which files changed.

## Folder permissions

| Folder | Permission |
|---|---|
| `00-Inbox/` | Read/write when processing a requested batch |
| `01-Daily-Notes/` | Create and append |
| `02-People/` | Read/write |
| `03-Projects/` | Read/write |
| `04-Areas/` | Read/write |
| `05-Resources/` | Read/write |
| `06-Archive/` | Read only unless move approved |
| `07-Attachments/` | No deletion without approval |
| `08-AI-History/` | Read/write |
| `09-Dreams/` | Only when asked |
| `10-Study/` | Read/write |
| `99-MOC/` | Read/write |
| `99-System/` | Read/write, ask before deleting rules/scripts |
| `Legacy/` | Off limits by default |

## Companion context

Only these files are intended for routine Companion Agent sharing:

```text
99-System/companion/ABOUT-ME.md
99-System/companion/CURRENT-SEASON.md
99-System/companion/PROJECTS.md
99-System/companion/COMPANION-RULES.md
99-System/companion/CONTEXT-PACK.md
```

Do not expose the whole vault to a companion by default.

## Session close

When I say `wrap up`, create or update:

```text
08-AI-History/YYYY-MM-DD_session.md
```

Include:

```markdown
# Session — YYYY-MM-DD

## Files changed
-

## Open threads
-

## Next action
-
```
